course: dictionary
lesson: 10483
title: A soup dish in a silly song
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Sometimes a word is hard because you rarely meet it. Then the other words in the sentence are your best clue. «Beautiful Soup, so rich and green, Waiting in a hot tureen!» The soup is waiting in a hot tureen, so a tureen must be something that holds hot soup.
explain: Ask yourself what would fit in the gap. «The cook filled the ___ with hot soup and put on the lid.» A deep bowl with a lid fits, so a tureen is probably a serving dish. Then put your meaning into the sentence and check that it still makes sense.
explain: The words around it tell you what the tureen is for. In «a soup tureen», the word soup shows what the dish holds. When the clues are not enough, a dictionary will settle it.
fact: A tureen is a large, deep bowl with a lid.
fact: Soup is served from a tureen at the table.
fact: A tureen can also be a similar dish for serving vegetables or sauce.
fact: In «Alice's Adventures in Wonderland», the Mock Turtle sings about a «hot tureen».
fact: Mock turtle soup was a real Victorian dish, so the song is a funny joke about soup.
exercise: «Waiting in a hot tureen!» What is a tureen? | *A large, deep bowl with a lid for serving soup | A small spoon for stirring tea | A flat plate for cake | A tall glass for lemonade
exercise: In grand houses, what is a soup tureen used for? | *To serve soup at the table | To hang on a wall as a picture | To keep a pet turtle in | To wash the dishes in
exercise: In «a soup tureen», which word tells you what the dish is for? | a | tureen | *soup
test: Which of these is a tureen? | *A deep dish with a lid for soup | A tall glass for milk | A flat plate for cake
test: A tureen can also hold which of these? | Sand and stones | Coins and buttons | Cake and biscuits | *Vegetables or sauce
exam: Lily says a tureen must be a kind of turtle, because of the song. What is the right meaning? | *A large, deep dish with a lid, used to serve soup | A spoon for stirring soup | A kind of turtle that lives in the sea | A fancy hat worn at a feast
